{"2073620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arena Breakout: Infinite", "steam_appid": 2073620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/88fe1763fe2892b0c4d359e1b094a11b.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1170 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/cfa9a04508da49cb3b1393d42d740077.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/cfa9a04508da49cb3b1393d42d740077.webm?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/cfa9a04508da49cb3b1393d42d740077.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season 6 kicks off ABI 2.0, the next phase of our development. This massive update introduces a brand-new PvE mode, new weather conditions, the Mastery system, new weapons, and community-requested balance adjustments and system updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/f3fab4723221cc173ad0d2c2dc0ec05d.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/f3fab4723221cc173ad0d2c2dc0ec05d.avif?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/49e37ceec42a260516081f657d05b45e.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/49e37ceec42a260516081f657d05b45e.webp?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every raid in Arena Breakout: Infinite (abi) is a gamble between glory and ruin. From intense PvP firefights to challenging PvE encounters, every decision carries risk, reward, and consequences. Outthink, outgun, and extract - before the zone swallows you whole. In Kamona, true victory belongs to those who can adapt, survive, and make it out with their loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.webm?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1d907d79195d8719cd79ceea8dfd81b2.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/1d907d79195d8719cd79ceea8dfd81b2.webp?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 6 distinct maps spanning chaotic indoor CQB, open terrain, and unpredictable wilderness firefights. Adapt to a realistic, dynamic weather system—featuring sun, night, fog, storms, and freezing blizzards—where a sudden drop in visibility can mean the difference between extraction and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.webm?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/c2767a7a756286ab409922a6128877b2.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/c2767a7a756286ab409922a6128877b2.webp?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unparalleled weapon customization built for military enthusiasts. Choose from over 75 weapons and 900+ mods across 20+ attachment slots to craft your tactical masterpiece. Fine-tune handling, recoil, and range to optimize your loadout for different raids, and make every setup feel entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.webm?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1ace73912c71f8bf8e63fef267181359.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/1ace73912c71f8bf8e63fef267181359.webp?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Kamona with a streamlined path into the raid experience. Intuitive tutorials and rich quality-of-life features help you learn the ropes and master the basics. Progress through three distinct difficulty tiers—Normal, Lockdown, and Forbidden Zone—as you evolve from a rookie recruit into a legendary professional operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.webm?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80f4e2d75699b30210d4fe72837640fe.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/80f4e2d75699b30210d4fe72837640fe.webp?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Breakout: Infinite offers a variety of game modes for all operators - Tactical Ops, Solo Ops, Covert Ops and limited-time gameplay events. Whether you prefer tactical teamwork or going in alone, you decide how you take on the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.webm?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/c0d776fcc809fedc1ac9f58e35fb9d74.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/c0d776fcc809fedc1ac9f58e35fb9d74.webp?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arena Breakout: Infinite, fair combat is a guarantee with our ever-improving, anti-cheat system. This includes Killcam Replays that allow you to submit a one-tap report whenever you flag suspicious activity. Moreover, if you’re confirmed to have lost a match due to cheating, automatic in-game compensation will hit your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akama