eam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80f4e2d75699b30210d4fe72837640fe.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/80f4e2d75699b30210d4fe72837640fe.webp?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Breakout: Infinite offers a variety of game modes for all operators - Tactical Ops, Solo Ops, Covert Ops and limited-time gameplay events. Whether you prefer tactical teamwork or going in alone, you decide how you take on the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.webm?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/c0d776fcc809fedc1ac9f58e35fb9d74.avif?t=1785832840\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/c0d776fcc809fedc1ac9f58e35fb9d74.webp?t=1785832840 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arena Breakout: Infinite, fair combat is a guarantee with our ever-improving, anti-cheat system. This includes Killcam Replays that allow you to submit a one-tap report whenever you flag suspicious activity. Moreover, if you’re confirmed to have lost a match due to cheating, automatic in-game compensation will hit your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.poster.avif?t=1785832840\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.webm?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.mp4?t=1785832840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Arena Breakout: Infinite is a high-stakes tactical extraction shooter where every decision matters. Fight, loot, and extract—or lose it all. With stunningly realistic visuals, lifelike sound, and unforgiving PvPvE combat, every raid is a gamble between glory and ruin.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, German, Russian, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Arena Breakout aims to be a steely military simulator.”<br>IGN<br><br>“Arena Breakout: Infinite is a fun game that I can see myself turning to again and again.”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“If you are a fan of realistic military shooters, you should definitely check out Arena Breakout Infinite.”<br>Sportskeeda<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/c8b016ff8790f74ee14c5e556d52b846052bd367/header.jpg?t=1785832840", "capsule_im